  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.56 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Registration of Nurse Agencies",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.56 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Registration of Nurse Agencies. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.55, below, shall apply to the registration of nurse agencies under RSA 326-M:\n\nTable 1002.56 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Registration of Nurse Agencies\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nNurse agency registration application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of registration | 2 years | $160\n\nSource. #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
